<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Re posts final 1995 results.</title>
<headline>Swiss Re posts final 1995 results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1995</p>
<p>				   (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p>Group ordinary profit</p>
<p>  after tax		     1,092	     vs 709</p>
<p>Ord profit incl</p>
<p>  extraordinary income	1,101	     vs 932</p>
<p>NOTE - Swiss Reinsurance Co reported provisional figures for 1995 on April 25 that were slightly below the final results. In April, it put 1995 group ordinary net profit at 1,088 million Swiss francs and profits including extraordinary items at 1,095 million.</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE)     12.7 pct	  vs 8.7 pct</p>
<p> Gross premiums		 12,848	    vs 12,950</p>
<p> Dividend per share	   22.50 Sfr	 vs 15.00 Sfr</p>
<p> Capital funds		  9,130	     vs 8,019</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
